  "goal": {
    "zh_CN": "在休止处换气，用舒适音量唱稳三拍长音。",
    "en_US": "Breathe in the rests and sustain three beats at a comfortable volume."
  },
  "steps": {
    "zh_CN": "1. 听清三拍长音和一拍休止。\n2. 在休止时自然换气，不把长音越唱越响。\n3. 先用 u，再用 a，重复短句。\n4. 查看音高曲线和长音结束时刻。",
    "en_US": "1. Hear the three-beat tone and one-beat rest.\n2. Breathe naturally in the rest and keep a steady volume.\n3. Practise with u, then a.\n4. Review the pitch curve and release timing."
  },
  "selfCheck": {
    "zh_CN": "声音是否稳定？是否唱满三拍？休止处是否停止发声？",
    "en_US": "Is the tone steady? Does it last three beats? Do you stop in the rest?"
  },
